stem feature_tour, registered as FeatureTour
24 TODO `@export_enum` became a plain `@export`: the inspector hint it gives has no Verse attribute yet
31 TODO `health`'s accessors became `SetHealth`: this file calls them, but a value Godot writes -- the inspector, a scene, an animation -- goes straight to `Health` and skips them
74 note `_has_point` became `HasPointValue`: `HasPoint` is already a name Verse or the Godot mirror defines, and Verse refuses a member that shadows one
96 note `%` became `Mod[...]`, which is never negative where GDScript's `%` takes the sign of the left side
149 note the inner class `Helper` became the top-level class `feature_tour_helper`
